# Reasonix agent state — local session logs, the approved-command allowlist and
# pasted clipboard images. This is machine-local tooling, not project source: it
# churns on every session (and reasonix.toml hardcodes an absolute path), so it
# stays out of the repo. Previously only .reasonix/attachments was ignored here,
# which is how .reasonix/tasks ended up tracked.
